	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダムSEED FRAME ASTRAYS」より“グフイグナイテッド（ルドルフ・ヴィトゲンシュタイン専用機）”がHGでキット化 パーソナルマークや機体各部のマーキングは専用シールで再現 特徴的な機体色はツヤのある新規成形色で再現 ビームソードはシールドに収納可能な短剣タイプとビーム刃をクリアパーツで再現した延長タイプの２つが付属 ヒートロッドはクリアパーツで再現、表情の付いた2種類が付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Mobile Suit GundamSEED FRAME ASTRAYS\", \"Gouf Ignited (Rudolf Wittgenstein's special machine)\" is made into a HG kit.Personal marks and markings on each part of the aircraft are reproduced with special seals.Characteristic aircraft colors are reproduced with glossy new molding colors.Two types of beam swords are included: a dagger type that can be stored in the seal, and an extension type that reproduces the beam blade with clear parts. The heat rod is reproduced with clear parts, and two types with facial expressions are included."
		]
	},
